### Create product (expected 201)
POST http://localhost:8081/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Dell Inspiron",
  "description": "Laptop phuc vu hoc tap",
  "price": 18500000.00,
  "quantity": 10
}

### List products (expected 200)
GET http://localhost:8081/products

### Get one product (replace 1 with returned ID)
GET http://localhost:8081/products/1

### Update product (expected 200)
PUT http://localhost:8081/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Dell Inspiron 15",
  "description": "Da nang cap RAM",
  "price": 19500000.00,
  "quantity": 7
}

### Delete product (expected 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/products/1

### Validation (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","price":-100,"quantity":-1}

### Not found (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/products/999999
